    <mxCell id="an_bad_T150" value="&lt;div style='width:414px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:8px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10.8px;font-weight:900;color:#991B1B;'&gt;✕ HYPE-DRIVEN STACK SPRAWL:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='font-size:12.2px;color:#0F172A;font-weight:600;'&gt;Merging every trending Twitter repo straight into customer prod&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#FECACA;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="140" width="424" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="an_good_T150" value="&lt;div style='width:426px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:8px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10.8px;font-weight:900;color:#065F46;'&gt;✓ 4-RING EVIDENCE GATES:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='font-size:12.2px;color:#0F172A;font-weight:600;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Adopt (Paved Road) • Trial (2 Squads) • Assess (POC) • Hold (Ban)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#A7F3D0;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="462" y="140" width="434" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="rd_tl" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;SHINY-OBJECT CHAOS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;14 Frameworks in Prod&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Letting Every Squad Pick Random GitHub AI Libraries&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Without an org-wide &lt;b&gt;Adopt / Trial / Hold radar&lt;/b&gt;, 6 teams ship 6 incompatible vector DBs and unvetted agent wrappers.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#DC2626;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;3.4× Maintenance Burn&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="38" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rd_tr" value="&lt;div style='width:400px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#059669;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;QUARTERLY TECH RADAR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#D1FAE5;color:#065F46;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;CTO &amp; Principal Tool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Publish a 1-Page Quarterly AI Radar Across 4 Rings&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Promote patterns from &lt;b&gt;Trial → Adopt&lt;/b&gt; only after 2 teams prove &lt;b&gt;P95 latency, OBO security &amp;amp; pass^5 stability&lt;/b&gt; in prod.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.05;'&gt;-68% Toolchain Fragmentation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="478" y="212" width="404" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rd_bot" value="&lt;div style='width:832px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;background:#F8FAFC;border:1.4px solid #CBD5E1;border-radius:16px;padding:9px 13px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;'&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.2px;font-weight:900;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;MNEMONIC: A · D · O · P · T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;'&gt;Architecture Governance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Assess in Sandbox • Dogfood in 1 Squad (Trial) • Observe SLOs • Promote to Paved Road (Adopt) • Terminate Hold Debt&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12px;color:#334155;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.32;'&gt;Explicitly placing &lt;b&gt;Unbounded Swarms &amp;amp; Shared Admin Keys&lt;/b&gt; in the outer red &lt;b&gt;HOLD&lt;/b&gt; ring saves months of incident cleanup.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="42" y="788" width="836" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="c1_T150" value="&lt;div style='width:266px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:#2563EB;letter-spacing:0.4px;'&gt;◆ 30s STAFF+ INTERVIEW PITCH&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12.3px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.33;'&gt;&amp;ldquo;We govern AI stack sprawl with a quarterly &lt;b&gt;4-Ring Tech Radar&lt;/b&gt;: patterns enter &lt;b&gt;Adopt&lt;/b&gt; only with proven OBO auth, OTel, and pass^5 CI.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.4;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="984" width="274" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="c2_T150" value="&lt;div style='width:266px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0F766E;letter-spacing:0.4px;'&gt;▲ DAY-1 GCP ⇄ OSS STACK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12.3px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.33;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Google ADK + Vertex Eval + IAM OBO + Spanner&lt;/b&gt; ⇄ Thoughtworks-Style Radar JSON + Backstage&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.4;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="323" y="984" width="274" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

    <mxCell id="c3_T150" value="&lt;div style='width:266px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;padding:10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:#047857;letter-spacing:0.4px;'&gt;★ L5 → L7 PROMO IMPACT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:12.3px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.33;'&gt;Authoring the org&amp;rsquo;s &lt;b&gt;Quarterly AI Tech Radar&lt;/b&gt; is a textbook L6→L7 Principal multiplier&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.4;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="984" width="274" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

